  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implementing the Action Plan: Targeting Marine Turtle Conservation Needs in Cambodia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The recipient will; 1. conduct a systematic coastal survey to determine historic extent and location of nesting beaches and; 2. conduct education and outreach in schools and coastal communities; 3. work with FiA DFC to develop a working group that will identify and promote implemtation of National Action Plan; and 4. implement pilot bycatch reduction project in collaboration with Community fisheries organizations .</narrative>
  </description>
